{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Les 10 épreuves du décathlon."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0","s":"Named after the end of a river? Pretty boring."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"Go back to selling CDs at the megastore!"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2","s":"A direction and another direction... WOW, original!"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3","s":"This one is ironic because it doesn't go into the great unknown anymore, just Cleveland."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4","s":"You can't just say what you are and then a color!"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"I WAS going to fly to the corporate HQ to complain, but Dubai's too far for me to roll."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio6"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_6_hint","n":"ClueAudio6","s":"This European carrier just sounds dirty.\n\nALT. What to say about this European carrier... well... it's all in the tongue."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio7"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_7_hint","n":"ClueAudio7","s":"Sounds like \"Lift Hans,\" right? Whatever."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio8"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_8_hint","n":"ClueAudio8","s":"They call it this because if you take one of their flights your soul leaves your body.\n\nALT.  (mimicing the spirit cheer) \"We've got an airline, yes we do, we've got an airline, how 'bout you?\""},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio9"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_9_hint","n":"ClueAudio9","s":"Time to dissolve this \"union.\""},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio","s":"It's fine. It's FINE."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio"}]}
